            "$id": "15"
        },
        {
            "statement": {
                "_text": "Don\u2019t mind the lines of light all over. It comes with the territory of reaching the rank of Disciple in the Holy Mission. With these, I can resist and destroy Corruption with my very body. It\u2019s quite helpful in my work, to be honest.",
