        },
        {
            "statement": {
                "_text": "I would gladly teach you the Macefill technique for...Say 50 silvers. It will allow you to parry and negate an enemy\u2019s magical attack, and enchant your mace with it. You don\u2019t even need to be a mage to do it!",
